msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Request a free trial of SQOA Solver by completing this [form](https://www.j-ij.com/en/qiskit-function-access).\n"
"  - Visit the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver) for this Qiskit Function.\n"
"  - Try an end-to-end example in the [maximum independent set problem](/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa) tutorial.\n"
"  - Learn how to model optimization problems with [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-opt-mapper).\n"
"  - Learn how to model and exchange optimization problems with [JijModeling](https://jij-inc-jijmodeling-tutorials-en.readthedocs-hosted.com/en/latest/introduction.html) and [OMMX](https://ommx-en-book.readthedocs.io/en/latest/).\n"
"  - Read the SQOA-QR paper [\\[1\\]](#references) to learn more about the SQOA framework.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Empfehlungen\">\n"
"  - Fordere über dieses [Formular](https://www.j-ij.com/en/qiskit-function-access) eine kostenlose Testversion von SQOA Solver an.\n"
"  - Besuche die [API-Referenz](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver) für diese Qiskit Function.\n"
"  - Probiere ein End-to-End-Beispiel im Tutorial zum [Maximum-Independent-Set-Problem](/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa) aus.\n"
"  - Lerne, wie du Optimierungsprobleme mit [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-opt-mapper) modellierst.\n"
"  - Lerne, wie du Optimierungsprobleme mit [JijModeling](https://jij-inc-jijmodeling-tutorials-en.readthedocs-hosted.com/en/latest/introduction.html) und [OMMX](https://ommx-en-book.readthedocs.io/en/latest/) modellierst und austauschst.\n"
"  - Lies die SQOA-QR-Veröffentlichung [\\[1\\]](#references), um mehr über das SQOA-Framework zu erfahren.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

